BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 566.0 Td (For one product under a linear cost-volume-profit model, unit contribution margin equals) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 552.0 Td (selling price per unit less variable cost per unit. Fixed cost divided by unit contribution) Tj ET
