BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 524.0 Td (dollars. At break-even, total contribution exactly covers fixed cost and operating income is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 510.0 Td (zero. Keep units and currency consistent, and distinguish the contribution from gross margin) Tj ET
