BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 442.0 Td (CVP results are conditional estimates. Common simplifying assumptions include a stable selling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 428.0 Td (price, linear variable cost, fixed cost within a relevant range, and known sales mix. A change) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 414.0 Td (in capacity, overtime, discounting, product mix, or inventory can break those assumptions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 400.0 Td (Sensitivity analysis changes one or more inputs transparently and recomputes contribution and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 386.0 Td (break-even; it does not guarantee the forecast. A margin-of-safety measure compares expected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 372.0 Td (or actual sales with break-even, and operating leverage describes how a change in sales can) Tj ET
