BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 318.0 Td (A decision-relevant cost differs between alternatives and relates to a future consequence. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 304.0 Td (sunk cost is already incurred and cannot be changed by the current choice, while an avoidable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 290.0 Td (future cost may matter. Compare alternatives on consistent units and horizon, then include) Tj ET
