BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 194.0 Td (Question: A product sells for 80, has variable cost 50, and fixed cost 240,000. Find) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 180.0 Td (break-even volume under the one-product linear model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 166.0 Td (1. Unit contribution = 80 - 50 = 30 per unit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 152.0 Td (2. Break-even units = fixed cost ÷ unit contribution = 240,000 ÷ 30.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 138.0 Td (3. Check revenue and total cost at that volume.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 124.0 Td (Answer: 8,000 units.) Tj ET
